{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf456F64VjNjLjRisB5K3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DEyBAyJMPsZWCY7kp4TiEA","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat iw54pyk7/.agents/skills/task-spec/references/quick-reference.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1394,"cache_read_input_tokens":30504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1394},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0abf1529-dfad-44b4-923a-1389e8368909","uuid":"0f856f8b-e152-4820-b673-adff1b8f65f1","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:50:53.941Z","request_id":"req_011Cf456EcJ2FsWDVgCNYB7B","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01DEyBAyJMPsZWCY7kp4TiEA":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat iw54pyk7/.agents/skills/task-spec/references/quick-reference.md"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DEyBAyJMPsZWCY7kp4TiEA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Task-Spec quick reference\n2\t\n3\t```bash\n4\ttaskspec init\n5\ttaskspec setup signing\n6\ttaskspec setup\n7\t\n8\ttaskspec plan --manifest tasks/.plans/change.yaml\n9\ttaskspec batch --plan tasks/.plans/change.yaml\n10\ttaskspec validate tasks/T-*.md\n11\ttaskspec dod tasks/T-*.md\n12\ttaskspec gate --stamp tasks/T-…-leaf.md\n13\ttaskspec handoff tasks/T-…-leaf.md --backend codex --out .taskspec/handoffs/attempt.json\n14\ttaskspec run --ci tasks/T-…-leaf.md\n15\ttaskspec accept --handoff .taskspec/handoffs/attempt.json --stamp tasks/T-…-leaf.md\n16\ttaskspec transition T-…-leaf done\n17\ttaskspec graph --check\n18\ttaskspec status T-…-leaf\n19\ttaskspec doctor --backlog\n20\t```\n21\t\n22\t## Frontmatter essentials\n23\t\n24\t```yaml\n25\t---\n26\tid: T-YYYYMMDD-kebab-slug\n27\ttitle: One-line imperative\n28\tstatus: ready\n29\tformat_version: 3\n30\tprofile: standard\n31\teffort: S\n32\tbudget_iterations: 15\n33\tagent: any\n34\tparent: (none)\n35\tdepends_on: []\n36\ttouches_paths: [src/existing.py]\n37\tcreates_paths: [tests/test_change.py]\n38\tsource_note: tasks/.plans/change.yaml\n39\tcreated: 2026-08-11T00:00:00Z\n40\ttracker_ref: (none)\n41\texecution_backend: any\n42\tsigned_off: false\n43\tsigned_off_by: (none)\n44\tsigned_off_at: (none)\n45\taccepted: false\n46\taccepted_by: (none)\n47\taccepted_at: (none)\n48\t---\n49\t```\n50\t\n51\tXL/XXL nodes add `children: [T-…, T-…]`, use empty write lists, and are not\n52\tdelegated. XS/S/M/L leaves omit `children`.\n53\t\n54\t## Proof chain\n55\t\n56\t| Step | Positive token | Meaning |\n57\t|---|---|---|\n58\t| Plan | `TASK_PLAN=OK` | Manifest is complete enough to preview |\n59\t| DoD | `DOD=COMPLETE` | Behavior/eval/Exit Check traceability is complete |\n60\t| Gate | `TIER=1` or `TIER=2` | Spec is delegate-safe at the reported trust tier |\n61\t| Run | exit 0 | Current evals pass |\n62\t| Accept | `ACCEPTED=1` | Post-gate passed; `--stamp` may write acceptance |\n63\t\n64\t## Rules to remember\n65\t\n66\t- Write scope is `touches_paths ∪ creates_paths`.\n67\t- `status: done` requires `accepted: true`.\n68\t- Never hand-edit `signed_off*` or `accepted*`.\n69\t- Valid HMAC v1/v2 is supervised Tier 2; re-stamp each active task for v3/TaskRevision coverage.\n70\t- Research credentials stay outside every Task-Spec contract.\n71\t- `--json`, `--dry-run`, `NO_COLOR`, and `TASKSPEC_COLOR` are global.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0abf1529-dfad-44b4-923a-1389e8368909","uuid":"5ab2f1f7-84b9-49eb-a96e-443011612163","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:50:53.948Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat iw54pyk7/.agents/skills/task-spec/references/quick-reference.md","content":"# Task-Spec quick reference\n\n```bash\ntaskspec init\ntaskspec setup signing\ntaskspec setup\n\ntaskspec plan --manifest tasks/.plans/change.yaml\ntaskspec batch --plan tasks/.plans/change.yaml\ntaskspec validate tasks/T-*.md\ntaskspec dod tasks/T-*.md\ntaskspec gate --stamp tasks/T-…-leaf.md\ntaskspec handoff tasks/T-…-leaf.md --backend codex --out .taskspec/handoffs/attempt.json\ntaskspec run --ci tasks/T-…-leaf.md\ntaskspec accept --handoff .taskspec/handoffs/attempt.json --stamp tasks/T-…-leaf.md\ntaskspec transition T-…-leaf done\ntaskspec graph --check\ntaskspec status T-…-leaf\ntaskspec doctor --backlog\n```\n\n## Frontmatter essentials\n\n```yaml\n---\nid: T-YYYYMMDD-kebab-slug\ntitle: One-line imperative\nstatus: ready\nformat_version: 3\nprofile: standard\neffort: S\nbudget_iterations: 15\nagent: any\nparent: (none)\ndepends_on: []\ntouches_paths: [src/existing.py]\ncreates_paths: [tests/test_change.py]\nsource_note: tasks/.plans/change.yaml\ncreated: 2026-08-11T00:00:00Z\ntracker_ref: (none)\nexecution_backend: any\nsigned_off: false\nsigned_off_by: (none)\nsigned_off_at: (none)\naccepted: false\naccepted_by: (none)\naccepted_at: (none)\n---\n```\n\nXL/XXL nodes add `children: [T-…, T-…]`, use empty write lists, and are not\ndelegated. XS/S/M/L leaves omit `children`.\n\n## Proof chain\n\n| Step | Positive token | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| Plan | `TASK_PLAN=OK` | Manifest is complete enough to preview |\n| DoD | `DOD=COMPLETE` | Behavior/eval/Exit Check traceability is complete |\n| Gate | `TIER=1` or `TIER=2` | Spec is delegate-safe at the reported trust tier |\n| Run | exit 0 | Current evals pass |\n| Accept | `ACCEPTED=1` | Post-gate passed; `--stamp` may write acceptance |\n\n## Rules to remember\n\n- Write scope is `touches_paths ∪ creates_paths`.\n- `status: done` requires `accepted: true`.\n- Never hand-edit `signed_off*` or `accepted*`.\n- Valid HMAC v1/v2 is supervised Tier 2; re-stamp each active task for v3/TaskRevision coverage.\n- Research credentials stay outside every Task-Spec contract.\n- `--json`, `--dry-run`, `NO_COLOR`, and `TASKSPEC_COLOR` are global.\n","numLines":72,"startLine":1,"totalLines":72}}}
