irst).\n106\t  # verifies: the behavior id(s) this eval proves. Standard/full profiles require\n107\t  # every B-N to be covered by >=1 eval and every eval to map to a behavior.\n108\t  - id: eval_1\n109\t    description: {{EVAL_1_DESCRIPTION}}\n110\t    runnable: bash\n111\t    check_type: deterministic\n112\t    verifies: [B-1]\n113\t    terminal: true\n114\t    expected_duration_sec: {{EVAL_1_DURATION}}\n115\t  - id: eval_2\n116\t    description: {{EVAL_2_DESCRIPTION}}\n117\t    runnable: bash\n118\t    check_type: deterministic\n119\t    verifies: [B-2]\n120\t    terminal: true\n121\t    expected_duration_sec: {{EVAL_2_DURATION}}\n122\t  - id: eval_3\n123\t    description: {{EVAL_3_DESCRIPTION}}\n124\t    runnable: bash\n125\t    check_type: deterministic\n126\t    verifies: [B-1, B-2]\n127\t    terminal: true\n128\t    expected_duration_sec: {{EVAL_3_DURATION}}\n129\t\n130\tretry_policy:\n131\t  max_iterations: 15\n132\t  circuit_breaker_no_progress: 3\n133\t  on_terminal_failure: park_with_context\n134\t\n135\tagent_contract:\n136\t  version: 2\n137\t  read: [intent, behavior, contract, guardrails, operations]\n138\t  produce:\n139\t    - code\n140\t    - docs\n141\t    - config\n142\t    - tests\n143\t  required_tools: [git, bash]\n144\t  timeout_minutes: 30\n145\t  sandbox_type: host  # host | isolated | ephemeral\n146\t  output_artifacts: []\n147\t  mcp_dependencies: []\n148\t  emit:\n149\t    - pass\n150\t    - fail\n151\t    - retry_with_reason\n152\t    - parked_with_context\n153\t  backend_metadata: {}  # optional executor-specific key/value map (the backend names itself); replaces the old codex_metadata/kimi_metadata\n154\t```\n155\t\n156\t---\n157\t\n158\t## Exit Check\n159\t\n160\t```bash\n161\t# Final proof-of-done. Returns 0 only when ALL evals pass.\n162\teval_1 && eval_2 && eval_3\n163\t```\n164\t\n165\t---\n166\t\n167\t## Rollback Plan\n168\t\n169\tIf execution fails mid-task, revert to the pre-task state:\n170\t\n171\t1. **Git revert** — `git revert --no-commit HEAD` (if commits were made)\n172\t2. **File restore** — `git checkout -- <paths>` for any modified files not yet committed\n173\t3. **State reset** — update task status to `parked` and record `blocked_reason`\n174\t\n175\t{{ROLLBACK_SPECIFIC_STEPS}}\n176\t\n177\t(Replace with `(none — this task is append-only or additive with no destructive changes)` if no rollback is needed. Full profile requires concrete steps.)\n178\t\n179\t---\n180\t\n181\t## Observability Hooks\n182\t\n183\tWhat to watch during execution and after deployment:\n184\t\n185\t- **Expected duration:** {{OBSERVABILITY_EXPECTED_DURATION}}\n186\t- **Key metric:** {{OBSERVABILITY_KEY_METRIC}}\n187\t- **Alert condition:** {{OBSERVABILITY_ALERT_CONDITION}}\n188\t- **Log tail:** {{OBSERVABILITY_LOG_TAIL}}\n189\t\n190\t(Replace with `(none — no runtime observability required)` if not applicable. Full profile requires real hooks.)\n191\t\n192\t---\n193\t\n194\t## Anti-Patterns\n195\t\n196\t- **Don't {{ANTI_1_ACTION}}** — {{ANTI_1_REASON}}. {{ANTI_1_INSTEAD}}.\n197\t- **Don't {{ANTI_2_ACTION}}** — {{ANTI_2_REASON}}. {{ANTI_2_INSTEAD}}.\n198\t- **Don't {{ANTI_3_ACTION}}** — {{ANTI_3_REASON}}. {{ANTI_3_INSTEAD}}.\n199\t\n200\t---\n201\t\n202\t## Do-Not-Touch\n203\t\n204\tFiles the executor MUST NOT modify:\n205\t\n206\t- {{TODO: exact path or (none)}}\n207\t\n208\t---\n209\t\n210\t## Open Questions\n211\t\n212\tThings the executor should resolve DURING build, not assume:\n213\t\n214\t1. **{{QUESTION_1}}** — {{QUESTION_1_CONTEXT}}\n215\t2. **{{QUESTION_2}}** — {{QUESTION_2_CONTEXT}}\n216\t\n217\t(Replace with `(none — this task is fully specified)` if no open questions remain.)\n218\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0abf1529-dfad-44b4-923a-1389e8368909","uuid":"48b96dca-512a-4c61-a9fc-f3b33af46c06","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:53:45.564Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat iw54pyk7/tasks/T-202609